# Upload only what the static site build needs: the web app and the committed reports and docs it
# imports. Backend code, model folders, datasets and local caches never leave the machine.
/*
!/web
!/reports
!/docs
!/package.json
!/pnpm-workspace.yaml
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/vercel.json
/web/node_modules
/web/dist
/web/dist-ssr
/web/test-results
/web/playwright-report
